<title>UNITED NATIONS: U.S. says illegal Iraq gasoil trade via Iran grows.</title>
<headline>U.S. says illegal Iraq gasoil trade via Iran grows.</headline>
<text>
<p>UNITED NATIONS, (Reuter) Feb 3 -- Increasing amounts of Iraqi gasoil are being smuggled through Iranian waters in violation of U.N. sanctions, according to a briefing Monday by U.S. naval commanders to the U.N. sanctions committee on Iraq.</p>
<p>U.S. officials reiterated charges made over the previous months that Iranians were receiving protection money to permit Iraqi vessels passage, skirting U.S.-led multinational patrols enforcing sanctions in the Arabian Gulf waters off Iraq.</p>
</text>
